# The Containerfile copies only pyproject.toml, uv.lock, README.md and src/. These patterns keep secrets, session
# and database files, tests and docs out of the build context even if a COPY grows. Env files are matched at every
# depth, whatever their name before the suffix (src/tgaud/production.env).
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
build
dist
docs
tests
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.session
**/*.session-journal
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.csv
